Description: Reads models in the Systems Biology Markup Language ('SBML')
    (Hucka et al. (2003) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btg015>) through the
    bundled 'libSBML' library (Bornstein et al. (2008)
    <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btn051>). Lists a model's species,
    parameters, compartments, reactions, rules, events and function
    definitions, and converts the model into ready-to-run simulation code
    for 'deSolve', 'mrgsolve', 'rxode2', 'MATLAB', 'Julia' or 'ubiquity'.
    Models are read, not modified.
